# Only twa-manifest.json is source here. Everything else in this directory is
# generated by `bubblewrap build` from that file — the whole Gradle project
# included — and hand-edits to it get overwritten on the next build. Change
# twa-manifest.json and rebuild instead. See ../ANDROID.md.

# Generated Android project
app/
gradle/
gradlew
gradlew.bat
build.gradle
settings.gradle
gradle.properties
local.properties
.gradle/
build/
store_icon.png

# Bubblewrap's own hash of twa-manifest.json, used to notice that the generated
# project has drifted from it. Derived, and machine-local — regenerated by the
# next `bubblewrap update`.
manifest-checksum.txt

# Build outputs
*.apk
*.aab
*.idsig
output.json

# Never commit a signing key. This project's key lives outside the repo, at
# ~/Projects/keys/georgelands-twa.keystore — losing it means the app can never
# be updated in place, because the fingerprint is baked into the assetlinks.json
# served by all five origins.
*.keystore
*.jks
